                <note rend="inline" type="source">875.6363/104: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Albania</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Swift</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tirana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-08-03T16:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 3,
                                1923—4 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received August 4—2:09
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>47. Albanian Parliament convenes extraordinary session August 20th for discussion
                    of oil concessions.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Swift</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
